{"SMALL_TALK","st=friendly",{"Well, you're talking to me, that makes a change","You don't want anything off me? Just talking?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="People mostly yell lately, or want me to go away",afterMs=2500},{t="So, uh... thanks for stopping",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="Huh - all right - that's... yeah, that's nice",afterMs=2500},{t="Sorry, go on",afterMs=2000}}}},
{"SMALL_TALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, yeah, it's, it's something, isn't it? the quiet, I mean","Nice day, I guess, if you ignore everything, which I'm trying to do","Quiet, isn't it? too quiet, I hate it, I miss noise","Hot, isn't it? always hot, always sticky, I miss air conditioning so much","Anything else? I mean, I don't know what to say, I'm out of practice talking","Ha -- small talk, I forgot we did that, it's nice","Funny weather, funny world, funny everything, I guess"}},
{"SMALL_TALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Quiet today, which is good, quiet is good","Hot out, ain't it? Sticky too, my shirt's glued to me","Well, can't complain, well, I can, but nobody's listening","Anything new? no? me neither, same old, same old","Another day, another dollar, except no dollars, just days"}},
{"SMALL_TALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"It's good to talk, isn't it? it's good to hear a voice, any voice","Let's just sit and chat, no pressure, no agenda, just two people","Quiet today, huh? I like it quiet, but I keep waiting for the other shoe to drop","Not much else to talk about, honestly, we're alive, and that is all I've got","We could talk about food, but that just makes me sad","I keep thinking about my garden, silly, right? Tomatoes would be ripe now","Keep talking. Tell me what you'd put on a Hot Brown if there was any bread left","Let's talk about anything but the dead, anything at all","So, what's your favorite color? That's a dumb question, but I'm bored"}},
{"SMALL_TALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Small talk? No, thanks!","Say what you mean","I don't do small talk!!","Keep it moving","Who's asking, and what do you want from me","Nothing to say!","Weather's fine, you can admire it from over there","Not in a chatting mood - say what you need"}},
{"SMALL_TALK","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's a blessing to speak of small things, in a time of large ones"}},
{"SMALL_TALK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Small talk? Now? Seriously?","We can chat when it's quiet, when they're gone!","Not the time, not the time, not the time","You're brave, or crazy, to talk at a time like this","Shhh, nice weather, shhh, nice, keep it down"}},
